      "side": 1,
      "message": "Anything in PRODUCT_SOONG_NAMESPACES or the root namespace is exported to Make through out/soong/Android-${TARGET_PRODUCT}.mk.  When building inside Make there is an additional requirement that all modules in the root namespace and any namespaces in PRODUCT_SOONG_NAMESPACES have unique names.",
